  "nameEn": "Comb",
  "descriptionNightEn": "For each of the three teeth: walk up to it, turn left and walk to the end of the tooth, light the lamp, turn the robot around, return to the path and carry on.",
  "descriptionEn": "Three teeth of different lengths branch off the path, with a lamp at the end of each. The lengths differ, so a counter will not help here.",
  "descriptionDayEn": "For each of the three teeth: walk up to it, turn left and walk to the end of the tooth, turn off the lamp, turn the robot around, return to the path and carry on."
